      ":question/id": "96a197eb-7ab2-5ad0-99b5-ddf702643c2f",
      ":question/problem": "If $P$ is a $15\\times 8$ matrix that has $2$ **non-pivot** columns, then $\\text{rank}(P)=$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We know that $\\text{rank}(P)$ is the number of pivot columns in $P.$ \n\nSince $P$ has $8$ columns and $2$ of them are non-pivots, then the number of pivot columns in $P$ is \n\n$$\n8-2=6.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{rank}(P)=6.$",
